  "title": "Absolutely Wonderful Cheesy, Creamy Spinach Artichoke Dip",
  "description": "Simply mix and bake spinach, artichokes, sour cream, and heavy cream together to make this wonderfully creamy and cheesy appetizer dip.",
  "authors": [
